  textBox: {fileID: 6812362434412798722}
  text: {fileID: 7102743105395631819}
  slides:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1fa8b3f622247b447bb22859890c4388, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: d9a3e6b0ab2ac304f970ea7175731e32, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 87d27f4483cc2d442bb76ba7a35ff3f3, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2f6964682f9a75544b7c2654b1df2f5e, type: 3}
  slideTexts:
  - Once upon a time, a town of hamsters and cats lived by the Towntopia river.
  - One day, a company called COMPANY INC LLC introduced their technology into the
    lives of this town.
  - "Over time, COMPANY INC LLC started to bring more of their influence over the
    hamsters and the cats. No one noticed it at first\u2026"
  - But the effects would not be unnoticeable for long.
  - COMPANY INC LLC had developed a foothold in the Town government and used their
    influence to gain a building permit for a data center by the town river.
  - Many of the residents were uncomfortable with the decision.
  - "Everyone asked themselves, \u201Cwhat will happen to our old way of life if
    something so resource-consuming is built?\u201D"
  - But everyone was too afraid to say anything.
  - "What will happen to the hamsters and the cats of Towntopia? Will they be able
    to stop the building of the data center\u2026 before it\u2019s too late?"
  textSpeed: 0.02
  dayCountdown: {fileID: 0}
  HOME_SCENE: Home
